---
/**
 * One card: after swimming we feel cold, more so in the wind. Left: a wet swimmer on a warm beach (25 °C); right: a
 * magnifier on the water film on the skin. Molecules leave the film at a steady rate (the fastest ones, drawn red at
 * first: they slow down while breaking away); in the air they wander at random and the ones that hit the film come
 * back. In still air the vapour gathers over the skin and about 3 of 4 molecules return; from x = 0.4 of the run the
 * wind blows the vapour away (drift grows with the height over the film, as in a real boundary layer), only about 1
 * of 4 returns, and the net evaporation is about 3 times faster (the counts are measured in the simulation). The
 * swimmer shivers and hugs himself; the drops on his skin dry up. Uses the runner of the opening scenes (scene.ts).
 */
import More from '@components/More.astro';

const uid = `vsw${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8)}`;
// magnifier: centre and radius; the water film from FT to FB, the skin below
const L = { x: 318, y: 118, r: 70 };
const FT = 120;
const FB = 148;
const film = Array.from({ length: 22 }, (_, i) => ({ x: 254 + (i % 11) * 13 + (i >= 11 ? 6 : 0), y: i < 11 ? 127 : 140 }));
const skinDrops = [
	[145, 125, 0.22],
	[157, 140, 0.55],
	[147, 151, 0.62],
	[142, 134, 0.36],
	[132, 141, 0.68],
	[168, 146, 0.74],
	[144, 190, 0.8],
	[156, 200, 0.88],
	[145, 205, 2],
	[157, 84, 2],
];
---

<figure class="vsw not-content" data-vsw>
	<svg class="vsw__svg" viewBox="0 0 400 256" role="img" aria-label="Мальчик вышел из воды на пляж, воздух 25 °C. Под лупой — вода на его коже: из неё вылетают самые быстрые молекулы. Без ветра пар остаётся у кожи и многие молекулы возвращаются; когда дует ветер, пар уносится, молекулы почти не возвращаются, вода испаряется быстрее, и мальчик дрожит от холода">
		<defs>
			<clipPath id={`${uid}-scene`}>
				<rect x="8" y="8" width="224" height="216" rx="8" />
			</clipPath>
			<clipPath id={`${uid}-lens`}>
				<circle cx={L.x} cy={L.y} r={L.r} />
			</clipPath>
		</defs>
		<rect class="vsw__bg" x="0" y="0" width="400" height="256" rx="8" />

		<!-- the beach -->
		<g clip-path={`url(#${uid}-scene)`}>
			<rect class="vsw__sky" x="8" y="8" width="224" height="150" />
			<g class="vsw__sun">
				<circle cx="34" cy="34" r="12" />
				{Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => (
					<line x1="17" y1="0" x2="23" y2="0" transform={`translate(34 34) rotate(${i * 45})`} />
				))}
			</g>
			<path class="vsw__sea" d="M8 150 H104 Q94 186 74 224 H8 Z" />
			<g class="vsw__waves">
				<path d="M14 170 q 8 -4 16 0 t 16 0 t 16 0 t 16 0" />
				<path d="M12 196 q 8 -4 16 0 t 16 0 t 16 0" />
			</g>
			<path class="vsw__sand" d="M104 150 H232 V224 H74 Q94 186 104 150 Z" />
			<g class="vsw__wind" data-wind>
				{[
					[18, 64, 0],
					[40, 92, 0.45],
					[10, 118, 0.9],
					[30, 142, 0.25],
					[56, 76, 1.2],
				].map(([x, y, d]) => (
					<path style={`--d:${d}s`} d={`M${x} ${y} q 12 -5 24 0 t 24 0`} />
				))}
			</g>
			<text class="vsw__windlabel" x="62" y="33" data-windlabel>ветер →</text>

			<!-- the swimmer -->
			<g data-boy>
				<rect class="vsw__skin" x="140" y="172" width="9" height="42" rx="4" />
				<rect class="vsw__skin" x="151" y="172" width="9" height="42" rx="4" />
				<path class="vsw__trunks" d="M138 158 H162 V178 H152 L150 172 L148 178 H138 Z" />
				<path class="vsw__skin" d="M137 116 Q137 110 143 109 H157 Q163 110 163 116 L161 160 H139 Z" />
				<rect class="vsw__skin" x="146" y="99" width="8" height="12" />
				<circle class="vsw__skin" cx="150" cy="90" r="12" />
				<path class="vsw__hair" d="M138 89 Q139 76 150 76 Q161 76 162 89 Q156 83 150 84 Q144 83 138 89 Z" />
				<circle class="vsw__ink" cx="145.5" cy="90" r="1.3" />
				<circle class="vsw__ink" cx="154.5" cy="90" r="1.3" />
				<path class="vsw__mouth" d="M146 96 q4 3 8 0" data-smile />
				<path class="vsw__mouth" d="M145 97 l2 -1.5 l2 1.5 l2 -1.5 l2 1.5 l2 -1.5" data-chatter />
				<g class="vsw__arms" data-arms-down>
					{['M139 115 Q131 136 133 158', 'M161 115 Q169 136 167 158'].map((d) => (
						<>
							<path class="vsw__arm-edge" d={d} />
							<path d={d} />
						</>
					))}
				</g>
				<g class="vsw__arms" data-arms-hug>
					{['M139 115 Q130 131 137 140 L158 131', 'M161 115 Q170 133 163 142 L142 133'].map((d) => (
						<>
							<path class="vsw__arm-edge" d={d} />
							<path d={d} />
						</>
					))}
				</g>
				<g data-skindrops>
					{skinDrops.map(([x, y, x0]) => <circle class="vsw__drop" cx={x} cy={y} r="1.8" data-x0={x0} />)}
				</g>
				<g class="vsw__shiver" data-shiver>
					<path d="M128 112 q -4 5 0 10 M124 116 q -3 3 0 6" />
					<path d="M172 112 q 4 5 0 10 M176 116 q 3 3 0 6" />
				</g>
			</g>
			<rect class="vsw__pill" x="128" y="16" width="96" height="24" rx="12" />
			<text class="vsw__read" x="176" y="33" text-anchor="middle">воздух 25 °C</text>
		</g>
		<rect class="vsw__frame" x="8" y="8" width="224" height="216" rx="8" />

		<!-- zoom from the shoulder to the magnifier -->
		<circle class="vsw__spot" cx="160" cy="121" r="5" />
		<path class="vsw__zoom" d={`M163 117 L${L.x - 12} ${L.y - L.r + 1} M163 125 L${L.x - 12} ${L.y + L.r - 1}`} />
		<text class="vsw__title" x={L.x} y="38" text-anchor="middle">под лупой: вода на коже</text>
		<g clip-path={`url(#${uid}-lens)`}>
			<rect class="vsw__air" x={L.x - L.r} y={L.y - L.r} width={2 * L.r} height={FT - (L.y - L.r)} />
			<rect class="vsw__film" x={L.x - L.r} y={FT} width={2 * L.r} height={FB - FT} />
			<rect class="vsw__skin" x={L.x - L.r} y={FB} width={2 * L.r} height={L.y + L.r - FB} />
			<path class="vsw__pores" d={`M262 162 q 6 -3 12 0 M296 170 q 6 -3 12 0 M336 160 q 6 -3 12 0 M360 174 q 6 -3 12 0`} />
			<text class="vsw__lab vsw__lab--skin" x={L.x} y="178" text-anchor="middle">кожа</text>
			<text class="vsw__lab" x={L.x} y="66" text-anchor="middle">воздух</text>
			<g data-film>
				{film.map((m) => <circle class="vsw__mol" cx={m.x} cy={m.y} r="4" />)}
			</g>
			<g data-vap></g>
		</g>
		<circle class="vsw__lens" cx={L.x} cy={L.y} r={L.r} />

		<text class="vsw__count vsw__count--out" x={L.x} y="206" text-anchor="middle">↑ вылетают за 1 с: <tspan data-out>8</tspan></text>
		<text class="vsw__count vsw__count--in" x={L.x} y="222" text-anchor="middle">↓ возвращаются: <tspan data-in>6</tspan></text>
		<text class="vsw__count vsw__count--net" x={L.x} y="240" text-anchor="middle">уходят в воздух: <tspan data-net>2</tspan></text>
		<text class="vsw__status" x="120" y="246" text-anchor="middle" data-status>Тихо: пар остаётся у кожи</text>
	</svg>
	<div class="vsw__foot">
		<p>Выйдя из воды, мы зябнем даже в жару, а <More term="на ветру — ещё сильнее">Без ветра пар скапливается у кожи, и многие его молекулы возвращаются в воду. Ветер уносит пар, молекулы почти не возвращаются, и вода испаряется в несколько раз быстрее — кожа остывает сильнее. Сравните числа под лупой до ветра и после. Числа — для модели: настоящих молекул несравнимо больше.</More>. С кожи испаряется вода: вылетают самые быстрые молекулы, и кожа остывает.</p>
		<button type="button" class="vsw__again" data-again>Повторить</button>
	</div>
</figure>

<style is:global>
